":80,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"engine.cylinder_count\"}},{\"id\":7,\"uid\":\"3e9d78a4-9f32-4697-acda-f74ec66b464e\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":76,\"w\":150,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Ignition Outputs\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":8,\"uid\":\"84983b4c-2461-432d-b951-185593848478\",\"type\":\"combobox\",\"x\":166,\"y\":72,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"engine.ign_enable\"}},{\"id\":9,\"uid\":\"a17870e1-b376-4d82-8369-13f71b217b8b\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":102,\"w\":420,\"h\":26,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"OFF \\u2014 no coil will fire, and this survives a reset.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#d08770\",\"wrap\":\"1\",\"condition\":\"[#engine.ign_enable] == 0\"}}]"}},{"id":10,"uid":"25ac1f06-5726-43aa-b737-ce1d6139d5b8","type":"label","x":10,"y":196,"w":430,"h":104,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Single coil fires through a distributor; wasted spark fires two cylinders a revolution apart from one coil; coil-on-plug is one output per cylinder. Changing either lays the coil outputs out again (IGN1 = cylinder 1 and so on); each IGN pin's own page under Electrical/Outputs shows its cylinder and its polarity, and is where one is changed by hand.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":11,"uid":"ea6fe7e8-592c-414e-a377-f109ef524149","type":"panel","x":460,"y":30,"w":440,"h":134,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Advance Limits","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":12,\"uid\":\"17f1ede5-5bc5-462e-b4d9-33579d17480c\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":150,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Max Advance\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":13,\"uid\":\"c4714e23-0288-4ff5-840f-12d54bda2f04\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":166,\"y\":12,\"w\":113,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"ignition.max_adv_deg\"}},{\"id\":14,\"uid\":\"bc2c75d1-6ca7-4fa7-a3e3-1e2d33adfd1f\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":150,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Min Advance\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"30ca0c72-d47d-4a27-b691-12401386489c\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":166,\"y\":42,\"w\":117,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"ignition.min_adv_deg\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"1b013ea4-7558-4c5c-b39d-d5a220840982\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":76,\"w\":150,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Overall Trim\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"0f15c595-7294-485f-abe1-41877ba00e35\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":166,\"y\":72,\"w\":117,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"ignition.overall_adv_trim\"}}]"}},{"id":18,"uid":"a106d6df-9e13-40c0-a279-47ab23840967","type":"label","x":460,"y":172,"w":430,"h":72,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"The limits clamp whatever the tables and corrections add up to, so a bad correction cannot run the engine into detonation. Positive is BTDC — advance. The trim moves every commanded angle at once and is meant for a quick global change, not for tuning.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":19,"uid":"8d4a83c2-d8cc-4982-903c-28d8e1a2f0c2","type":"panel","x":910,"y":30,"w":360,"h":134,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Fixed Timing","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":20,\"uid\":\"105dfb9a-7c27-4185-bb13-1084888bac2e\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"ignition.fixed_timing_enable\"}},{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"707fe70c-a361-4553-aa0f-90e598ccaca7\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":13,\"w\":220,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Fixed timing enabled\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"fd7873ab-1594-4c3f-8474-0bd68c5fb2ce\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":60,\"w\":130,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Fixed Advance\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#ignition.fixed_timing_enable] == 1\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"df9548c5-c5b5-4f46-8764-8fbfefa083ef\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":146,\"y\":56,\"w\":117,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"ignition.fixed_timing_deg\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#ignition.fixed_timing_enable] == 1\"}}]"}},{"id":24,"uid":"86bf6df0-69bd-47b9-b7b7-8e2b5b50a8a9","type":"label","x":910,"y":172,"w":280,"h":98,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Holds ONE advance whatever the map says, so a timing light can check that the crank sensor and the ECU agree about TDC. If the light reads what this box says, the trigger offset is right. It is a setup tool — leave it off to drive.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":25,"uid":"4e5e8cc3-a0de-469f-84ac-1954a00b8b5a","type":"panel","x":10,"y":312,"w":890,"h":130,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Right Now","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":26,\"uid\":\"f956e677-5437-4284-b608-65857a12d236\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":20,\"y\":14,\"w\":130,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$rpm]\",\"format\":\"%.0f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"a6980981-4013-4d5b-9928-a199838e914a\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":20,\"y\":44,\"w\":130,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Engine RPM\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"f787995f-3cc1-4e7d-a79d-8a15afcab085\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":160,\"y\":14,\"w\":130,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":11,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$advance]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"7be4ac0e-eee0-4918-8317-4ff4dc230ebf\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":160,\"y\":44,\"w\":130,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":11,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Advance\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":30,\"uid\":\"5d5fa507-9dbb-4192-991a-6f714a5c0abd\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":300,\"y\":14,\"w\":130,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":12,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$dwell]\",\"format\":\"%.0f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"bcbc4de4-73be-45d4-bd16-14a08ae98a80\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":300,\"y\":44,\"w\":130,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":12,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Dwell\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"c9dc688d-2a94-475f-bb5b-312893e8caac\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":440,\"y\":14,\"w\":130,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":13,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$battery]\",\"format\":\"%.2f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":33,\"uid\":\"b53757c2-0206-4b21-b401-0052a4bc289f\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":440,\"y\":44,\"w\":130,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":13,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Battery\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"f0624777-1589-4f8d-b72e-6fea2f5e2cb2\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":590,\"y\":20,\"w\":290,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Commanded advance against the limits above: if it sits exactly on Max, the limit is what is tuning the engine, not the table.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":35,"uid":"99f9e524-44cb-4c87-b8ae-70e081a84bf5","type":"panel","x":910,"y":322,"w":360,"h":128,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Then Tune It","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":36,\"uid\":\"ef974fe5-3b81-4efa-a329-e101d3d892bb\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":10,\"w\":300,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":14,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Advance Table\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Ignition Tuning/Advance Table\"}},{\"id\":37,\"uid\":\"3475d180-7a6b-4bf4-9da8-4350f21db26d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":38,\"w\":300,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":15,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Dwell Time\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Ignition Tuning/Dwell Time\"}},{\"id\":38,\"uid\":\"caddb4da-1e69-457f-a69b-536cbafc6804\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":66,\"w\":300,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":16,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Ignition Tuning\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Ignition Tuning\"}}]"}}]},"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System":{"uid":"46d6e0ab-562a-4652-997e-a58fc42c3e2b","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":716,"minWidth":1280,"canvasStatic":3,"canvasAnchor":0,"guideW":0,"guideH":0,"title":"Trigger System","layout":0,"gridColumns":2,"focusIndex":0,"borderColor":"","borderWidth":0,"borderStyle":1,"borderRadius":4,"titleFont":"","titleColor":"","titlePadding":4,"titleStyle":1,"titlePlace":0,"titleEdge":0,"titleAlign":0,"widgets":[{"id":1,"uid":"c98657e5-b501-4887-a574-95a5c15ed56f","type":"label","x":10,"y":4,"w":990,"h":40,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Where TDC is. Every angle the ECU commands — spark, injection, cam target — is measured from the reference these settings define, so nothing downstream can be more right than this page is.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":2,"uid":"efd780fa-6c83-4bc7-ae69-036faddcb31f","type":"panel","x":10,"y":46,"w":430,"h":104,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Crank Reference","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":3,\"uid\":\"945cc1df-71ca-4f77-82bc-d860623a83d7\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":180,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":2,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Trigger Offset BTDC\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":4,\"uid\":\"1e2dc67e-e508-4c22-8b6c-68561f15e73c\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":196,\"y\":12,\"w\":125,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":2,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.trigger_offset_btdc\"}},{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"a4562708-0d3d-4664-ac38-aa53cc08eaf1\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":180,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Pickup Angle\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"60cb3780-bdcb-4693-a4c7-de185a7e0d5a\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":196,\"y\":42,\"w\":125,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.sensor_angle\"}}]"}},{"id":7,"uid":"94bd56c8-89ef-4d36-bb5b-d49927484dd0","type":"label","x":10,"y":158,"w":420,"h":88,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"OFFSET is where the pattern's reference edge sits before TDC #1 — set it with a timing light and Fixed Timing on the Ignition System page. PICKUP is where the sensor is mounted around the wheel. Positive is BTDC, and the angle axis increases with rotation, so BTDC counts BACKWARDS from TDC.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":8,"uid":"c085bbff-70bf-4e65-a813-3a6f12c37814","type":"panel","x":10,"y":246,"w":430,"h":104,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Phase Sync Band","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":9,\"uid\":\"ccaa34c8-1fa9-415e-8de4-fbeb7d816ece\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":180,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Min RPM for Phase Sync\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":10,\"uid\":\"97dd6485-c774-427e-9833-63870f0d496f\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":196,\"y\":12,\"w\":142,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.min_full_sync_rpm_x10\"}},{\"id\":11,\"uid\":\"eecd240d-d9f9-4960-b3c9-7210b56f2f0d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":180,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Max RPM for Phase Sync\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":12,\"uid\":\"4468f578-983b-4a72-a5b0-845fe0005c75\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":196,\"y\":42,\"w\":142,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.max_full_sync_rpm_x10\"}}]"}},{"id":13,"uid":"1e17fc09-0e7d-44d9-914d-20917ca2e13d","type":"label","x":10,"y":358,"w":420,"h":72,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Phase sync is the CAM telling the ECU which revolution of the cycle it is on. It is only trusted inside this band: a VR cam sensor can glitch at cranking speed and again at the top of the range, and a false phase halves the engine's fuelling for a cycle.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":14,"uid":"382afb6f-ca95-44a6-b684-27e47ed70c18","type":"panel","x":450,"y":46,"w":380,"h":212,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Streams","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"f1f6ada3-4508-4506-8d5a-37cd7734ce39\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":12,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.streams[0].enabled\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"b9272d36-e1e9-44b9-aaee-5936ae5d6b91\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":10,\"w\":320,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Crank Primary\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System/Trigger Streams/Crank Primary\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#trigger.streams[0].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"b62ed6ed-ea44-4d4e-805c-8ddda13b53b8\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":40,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.streams[1].enabled\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"0351e24e-065d-49ea-84a3-f93da2bcc44e\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":38,\"w\":320,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Crank Secondary\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System/Trigger Streams/Crank Secondary\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#trigger.streams[1].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":19,\"uid\":\"a3ff7b17-1f59-461b-b016-bc77afa5ea00\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":68,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.streams[2].enabled\"}},{\"id\":20,\"uid\":\"2da57fe2-df82-46bc-bec4-eee6894d77c1\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":66,\"w\":320,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Cam Intake B1\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System/Trigger Streams/Cam Intake B1\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#trigger.streams[2].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"241919b0-b466-45ef-bd6f-3a60af5bbc01\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":96,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.streams[3].enabled\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"7cd38d6a-8637-41e7-b3d4-c09fc41be670\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":94,\"w\":320,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Cam Exhaust B1\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System/Trigger Streams/Cam Exhaust B1\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#trigger.streams[3].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"d8f0bfb4-5342-4da2-853d-948cb82771fa\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":124,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.streams[4].enabled\"}},{\"id\":24,\"uid\":\"b7452540-cfc7-40b8-a506-f6c777a79631\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":122,\"w\":320,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Cam Intake B2\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System/Trigger Streams/Cam Intake B2\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#trigger.streams[4].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"57c28632-b235-408d-b207-ea8713fd00d3\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":152,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":11,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"trigger.streams[5].enabled\"}},{\"id\":26,\"uid\":\"d795cda4-2c9d-434d-894c-dd8e3773e8e0\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":150,\"w\":320,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":11,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Cam Exhaust B2\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System/Trigger Streams/Cam Exhaust B2\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#trigger.streams[5].enabled] == 1\"}}]"}},{"id":27,"uid":"b9d78600-82a3-4ae7-a1b2-e31c29c5a630","type":"label","x":450,"y":266,"w":370,"h":72,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"A stream is one capture input and the pattern it is expected to see. The crank streams give RPM and position; a cam stream gives the phase, and on a VVT engine its nominal angle is what cam control measures against.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":28,"uid":"85e3101a-9d6f-4781-813c-8b062c12f4a5","type":"panel","x":840,"y":46,"w":430,"h":430,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Trigger Diagram","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"40e85669-2a74-459c-aef2-626ec25bd99f\",\"type\":\"triggerdiagram\",\"x\":10,\"y\":10,\"w\":400,\"h\":380,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{}}]"}},{"id":30,"uid":"580909c3-6af8-4dda-a587-e30ca8d1d9c4","type":"panel","x":840,"y":486,"w":430,"h":222,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Right Now","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"ea19b455-0ee9-4271-af7b-4c95010f623b\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":15,\"y\":14,\"w\":100,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":12,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$sync_level]\",\"format\":\"%.0f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"80719e87-4a39-4a22-beb0-ee6c9da9d977\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":44,\"w\":100,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":12,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Sync Level\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":33,\"uid\":\"5be913bb-9048-4bb4-b4c5-7b797df9c0ac\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":120,\"y\":14,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":13,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$crank_angle]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"ee30cd9f-c217-40f9-8093-2e850443c1a1\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":120,\"y\":44,\"w\":110,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":13,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Crank Angle\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":35,\"uid\":\"97125a3b-7cff-4b5d-a5b6-087d89eca4fe\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":235,\"y\":14,\"w\":100,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":14,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$rpm]\",\"format\":\"%.0f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":36,\"uid\":\"ce67ae7f-f766-47fe-99cc-fa8325c12bf0\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":235,\"y\":44,\"w\":100,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":14,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"RPM\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":37,\"uid\":\"6e08e124-1422-49eb-a9e5-675a61fc4159\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":70,\"w\":400,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Sync level: 0 none \\u00b7 1 crank \\u00b7 2 phase.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":38,\"uid\":\"a61304b7-f1d0-4485-a9ac-df3b5b1399a3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":92,\"w\":200,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Trigger Diagnostics  (live)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Configuration/Trigger System/Diagnostics\"}}]"}},{"id":39,"uid":"bb8f93d7-88b3-46a7-8773-40beb547d3f2","type":"panel","x":450,"y":358,"w":380,"h":174,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Engine-Sync Sampling","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":40,\"uid\":\"625ed05c-a6f2-40c9-9794-ab5b80cac6c6\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":180,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":15,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Averaging Window\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":41,\"uid\":\"db47bfff-a1f8-4e72-bf17-d931d05a054f\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":196,\"y\":12,\"w\":113,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":15,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.engine_sync_window_deg\"}},{\"id\":42,\"uid\":\"42706b33-3562-4a2e-adaf-571af9b93464\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":360,\"h\":98,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"How many degrees of crank the engine-synchronous inputs are averaged over. It exists for MAP: sampling manifold pressure at an arbitrary moment catches whatever the intake pulse is doing, so the reading swings with RPM rather than with load.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":43,"uid":"609680c3-f405-42a3-a3b0-baa042690a99","type":"panel","x":450,"y