align":"Left","fontName":"|16|0|0"}},{"id":3,"uid":"d08233c3-1091-483b-9b14-3c964da9b667","type":"label","x":136,"y":4,"w":839,"h":24,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"The driver's request. Two pedal tracks that must agree, the calibration that learns their travel, and the map from pedal to throttle.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":4,"uid":"45f4354f-1ded-4e80-8b62-58c9ae5d4082","type":"panel","x":10,"y":30,"w":330,"h":164,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"The Two Tracks","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#app.enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"a91d8bf0-f43c-4770-a5db-8db21a4c01fd\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Track A Sense\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"255876a6-bb4f-41d1-8857-9aef337f72b8\",\"type\":\"combobox\",\"x\":136,\"y\":12,\"w\":170,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"app.app1_sense\"}},{\"id\":7,\"uid\":\"bb28b117-43f5-43a2-b2de-18214180231c\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Track B Sense\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":8,\"uid\":\"16b81f6d-b07a-4ec2-9fa3-4efa2bb78818\",\"type\":\"combobox\",\"x\":136,\"y\":42,\"w\":170,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"app.app2_sense\"}},{\"id\":9,\"uid\":\"187b43db-e86a-4a3a-ab60-c91b54a93360\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":76,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Match Limit\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":10,\"uid\":\"2cc08963-0f81-444b-bf50-d96464263073\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":136,\"y\":72,\"w\":108,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"app.match_err_pct\"}},{\"id\":11,\"uid\":\"d467d70b-a64e-4216-9b3b-56ef834771e3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":106,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Match Debounce\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":12,\"uid\":\"88acba7e-b311-46db-b734-a3bcd42c1f0a\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":136,\"y\":102,\"w\":115,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"app.match_ms\"}}]"}},{"id":13,"uid":"4c50686d-9303-4e80-8680-deeabb6c0fc6","type":"label","x":10,"y":200,"w":320,"h":136,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"SENSE is declared, not discovered: a calibration sweep sees the same extremes whether the pedal was pressed then released or the other way round, so nothing in the signals can tell the studio which end is \"released\". A redundant pedal usually runs its second track the opposite way, so a short between the two is detectable — which is why B defaults to falling.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":14,"uid":"86935394-5c77-4e89-a7b5-67ee225a5277","type":"panel","x":10,"y":342,"w":330,"h":170,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Its Sensors","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#app.enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"fb407b61-b018-4a32-8b2e-183e41043eae\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":12,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[app_1].enabled\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"fa21d74d-f21e-444e-b462-671a522f32d7\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":10,\"w\":280,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Accelerator Pedal\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Sensors/Engine/Accelerator Pedal\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[app_1].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"1e8587f9-5324-44eb-bcb4-315ba27fb6bf\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":40,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[app_2].enabled\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"88aed873-1e86-4ef9-bd26-d24788227ae7\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":38,\"w\":280,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Accelerator Pedal 2\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Sensors/Engine/Accelerator Pedal 2\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[app_2].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":19,\"uid\":\"d5e765f7-da76-4be2-a578-490f2cf08c70\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":72,\"w\":310,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"These are the INPUTS. The switch at the top of the page is the pedal function itself \\u2014 it needs both of them.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":20,"uid":"be5cb9ed-71bf-494f-96b3-76a1e83e91a1","type":"panel","x":350,"y":30,"w":460,"h":576,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Pedal to Throttle","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#app.enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"1a9bf858-5542-4dc8-8ce7-2837e9d23436\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":8,\"w\":430,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Pedal to Throttle Table\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Functions/Accelerator Pedal/Pedal to Throttle\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"8dab5831-89e7-4b9a-9034-0a73a4eab4cd\",\"type\":\"curve\",\"x\":10,\"y\":48,\"w\":430,\"h\":430,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"app.pedal_to_throttle_table\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"axisUnit\":\"Auto\",\"valueUnit\":\"Auto\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"469076dd-435a-4e53-9724-a0cdd46e39a0\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":486,\"w\":430,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Pedal percent in, throttle percent out. A straight line is a pedal that commands what it is pressed to; bending it down low is what makes a car driveable on a big throttle body.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":24,"uid":"52a3fbbd-9562-4c3b-812e-739e8a47e3fe","type":"panel","x":820,"y":30,"w":450,"h":250,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Calibrate","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#app.enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"6ebb1755-f1ec-47bd-bc7d-664d84f2a870\",\"type\":\"command\",\"x\":10,\"y\":12,\"w\":200,\"h\":40,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Calibrate pedal\",\"command\":\"pedalcal\",\"enableCondition\":\"[$app_state] != 1\",\"ranges\":\"#ff8c28,,,,0,[$command_state] == 29;#30d158,,,,0,[$command_state] == 30;#ff453a,,,,0,[$command_state] == 31\"}},{\"id\":26,\"uid\":\"c7466723-72bd-48e7-b068-9d545acd20e6\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":220,\"y\":10,\"w\":220,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Engine stopped. Press the pedal fully and release it while it runs.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"e4b60bf0-1b62-4212-bc3a-07208a65f84d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":66,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Minimum Span\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"3cff199e-4663-4626-ad82-dc6836473ffe\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":156,\"y\":62,\"w\":124,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"app.cal_min_span\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"3df72552-41d5-4586-9254-3c627d704d2d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":100,\"w\":430,\"h\":116,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The sweep captures each track's raw extremes, in either order \\u2014 pressing first and releasing first give the same four numbers, which is why the direction comes from the sense above instead. A pedal that moves less than the minimum span did not really move, and the calibration aborts rather than writing a span that would make a twitch read as full throttle. While it runs, demand is held at zero.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":30,"uid":"6f6a039a-cea5-4e6b-bea7-e3db042a3eb9","type":"panel","x":820,"y":290,"w":450,"h":402,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Right Now","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"4b0ba1b0-c565-44fa-b43b-56443ad1c152\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":15,\"y\":14,\"w\":130,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":11,\"props\":{\"signalNam