e ECU has, and the third kind of output hardware beside the 22 low-side and 8 high-side drivers next door.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":2,"uid":"90868aea-bbfd-49d8-8499-b6957bffaac7","type":"panel","x":10,"y":30,"w":420,"h":128,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Bridges","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":3,\"uid\":\"4eb1daf8-604e-42df-95d7-369f802d523c\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":12,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":2,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[0].enabled\"}},{\"id\":4,\"uid\":\"bed9168e-4cf7-4da1-a3fe-bcd50c4436b3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":10,\"w\":350,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":2,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Half Bridge A\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Electrical/Half Bridges/Half Bridge A\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[0].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"3c34e149-8871-4777-b627-81a5912c3221\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":40,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[1].enabled\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"2c5ccc39-8e07-4a1f-a637-a195124abd27\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":38,\"w\":350,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Half Bridge B\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Electrical/Half Bridges/Half Bridge B\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[1].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":7,\"uid\":\"5459fc6a-4158-4dee-823c-f15650c612eb\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":74,\"w\":160,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"PWM Frequency\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":8,\"uid\":\"ebddc6da-4639-4185-a2d9-b2146aafef77\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":176,\"y\":70,\"w\":121,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.pwm_freq_hz\"}}]"}},{"id":9,"uid":"ad4011a7-05a7-4ac5-af31-4fe619d9c971","type":"panel","x":10,"y":170,"w":420,"h":240,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"What They Can Drive","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":10,\"uid\":\"8a4b06af-8686-4eb4-824f-4eaa80f025b7\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":12,\"y\":14,\"w\":396,\"h\":116,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Each bridge is a full H-bridge \\u2014 PWM, direction and enable \\u2014 so on its own it drives an electronic throttle servo, a PWM or BAC idle valve, or any DC motor that needs to go both ways. It does not know what is bolted to it: it realises whichever bus signal its Demand points at, and every integrator, ramp and limit belongs to the module publishing that signal.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":11,\"uid\":\"b4add3bf-843e-4736-98f4-0830c2b9a4b1\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":12,\"y\":108,\"w\":396,\"h\":98,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"AS A PAIR they drive one bipolar stepper, one coil each \\u2014 an idle valve, an electronic wastegate, anything stepped. That uses BOTH, so a stepper and an electronic throttle cannot share this ECU; two throttle bodies use both as well. Two is the whole supply.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#ff8c28\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":12,"uid":"3a688cdb-57b4-4efd-9cfb-1bf90ee8f5eb","type":"panel","x":450,"y":30,"w":420,"h":210,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Right Now","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":13,\"uid\":\"ef584777-9502-4fcf-b51c-eb36d313ded1\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":15,\"y\":14,\"w\":120,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_duty_1]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":14,\"uid\":\"28be3338-d48c-47f6-9bcf-9c329ebd0beb\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":44,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"A Duty\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"d95648c6-2862-4b17-906e-854559853700\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":145,\"y\":14,\"w\":120,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_duty_2]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"3b0c627f-d2a8-4aff-bb8f-b7bc1208c8f3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":145,\"y\":44,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"B Duty\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"a992e424-5aca-4748-b7d4-dcc2f9048bd2\",\"type\":\"indicator\",\"x\":275,\"y\":14,\"w\":60,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_en_1]\",\"onTitle\":\"A\",\"offTitle\":\"A\",\"onBg\":\"#30d158\",\"onFg\":\"#000000\",\"offBg\":\"#2a2a2e\",\"offFg\":\"#6e7178\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"1437102b-1aa8-4523-a9a0-409b8d6f8b5b\",\"type\":\"indicator\",\"x\":340,\"y\":14,\"w\":60,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_en_2]\",\"onTitle\":\"B\",\"offTitle\":\"B\",\"onBg\":\"#30d158\",\"onFg\":\"#000000\",\"offBg\":\"#2a2a2e\",\"offFg\":\"#6e7178\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\"}},{\"id\":19,\"uid\":\"1c2ea187-6243-4ddb-b366-d85de37c13d5\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":76,\"w\":390,\"h\":98,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Duty is what each bridge is driving, after its DC map, direction and authority clamp \\u2014 not what a controller asked for. A lit letter means those pins are live. A bridge with no demand signal assigned drives nothing, however well the module above it is tuned.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}}]},"Configuration/Electrical/Half Bridges/Half Bridge A":{"uid":"4fd75d7b-2539-457a-b4eb-187c137932ab","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":608,"minWidth":1280,"canvasStatic":3,"canvasAnchor":0,"guideW":0,"guideH":0,"title":"Half Bridge A","layout":0,"gridColumns":2,"focusIndex":0,"borderColor":"","borderWidth":0,"borderStyle":1,"borderRadius":4,"titleFont":"","titleColor":"","titlePadding":4,"titleStyle":1,"titlePlace":0,"titleEdge":0,"titleAlign":0,"widgets":[{"id":1,"uid":"710a20bc-42b5-4ed9-8be3-7c23be25508a","type":"checkbox","x":10,"y":3,"w":22,"h":22,"groupId":2,"props":{"signalName":"h_bridge.half[0].enabled"}},{"id":2,"uid":"ee865b0e-1d38-4d24-9ae3-ea2dd15dd966","type":"label","x":40,"y":5,"w":90,"h":20,"groupId":2,"props":{"labelText":"Enabled","align":"Left","fontName":"|16|0|0"}},{"id":3,"uid":"52fb33df-7e0d-48a1-bc2b-29491a5e980c","type":"label","x":136,"y":4,"w":864,"h":40,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"A bidirectional driver: it realises whichever bus signal it is pointed at. An electronic throttle servo, a PWM or BAC idle valve, a DC motor — or, with the other bridge, one coil of a bipolar stepper. There are two, and that is the whole supply.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":4,"uid":"f893c5f0-def0-4053-883c-89da1933286b","type":"panel","x":10,"y":46,"w":420,"h":104,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Commanded By","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#h_bridge.half[0].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"0cdaedd5-7e76-4a52-a7f8-e1fa4e615ed0\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Demand Signal\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"8f21dd87-8881-4c69-8b78-433792ad6eed\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":156,\"y\":12,\"w\":200,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[0].demand_sig\"}},{\"id\":7,\"uid\":\"410cb71b-db30-4c8e-8bfd-62dc0491e952\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Enable Signal\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":8,\"uid\":\"1208cd00-c1ee-4789-b775-ea990290c94d\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":156,\"y\":42,\"w\":200,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[0].enable_sig\"}}]"}},{"id":9,"uid":"053abe7b-66e8-4dff-bc04-24b9febe97f4","type":"label","x":10,"y":156,"w":410,"h":120,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Demand is the number the bridge drives to; Enable is the signal that permits it to drive at all — and a bridge drives only while it is actively enabled, which is what makes an unconfigured one safe. Whichever module owns the actuator publishes both: the throttle its etb_duty and etb_en, the stepper its coil demand and enable. A module with no bridge pointed at it moves nothing at all, however well it is tuned.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":10,"uid":"26d9975a-7a64-4a95-9f96-cfd9c72bdc5c","type":"panel","x":10,"y":278,"w":420,"h":194,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Drive","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#h_bridge.half[0].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":11,\"uid\":\"c1716afd-fc73-411d-a76c-7d33e16f36d8\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"DC Map\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":12,\"uid\":\"7fbf9446-3edd-4026-99dd-c6e960d03603\",\"type\":\"combobox\",\"x\":156,\"y\":12,\"w\":200,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[0].dc_map\"}},{\"id\":13,\"uid\":\"164a89bd-bf4f-46cc-8593-4dabc6441164\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Max Authority\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":14,\"uid\":\"6691d7aa-8d91-4420-a0d0-901d188cb2af\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":156,\"y\":42,\"w\":108,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[0].dc_max_pct\"}},{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"1e00115a-23b3-4cc4-98cd-a800806e7356\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":74,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[0].dir_invert\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"367cedc1-8878-4493-8b68-8b14395be9d0\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":71,\"w\":220,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Direction Invert\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"af25ba68-8084-4225-8092-288f0597ff8a\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":116,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"PWM Frequency\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"1bee3da3-0b69-4425-9e89-b37bcf393663\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":156,\"y\":112,\"w\":121,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.pwm_freq_hz\"}}]"}},{"id":19,"uid":"b109b172-abf2-4c07-ac9a-719357e1ba25","type":"label","x":10,"y":478,"w":410,"h":120,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"DC MAP follows the PRODUCER's sign convention, not the load: unipolar passes a signed demand straight through (-100..+100, which is what the throttle publishes), bipolar reads 0..100 with 50 as stop. Getting it backwards is quiet and nasty — a signed demand read as bipolar gives zero drive at +50 and full reverse at -50, so a calibration sweep measures no travel at all. The PWM frequency is shared by BOTH halves.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":20,"uid":"98186643-9018-4e99-b1a1-f4c91fbb0acb","type":"panel","x":450,"y":46,"w":400,"h":270,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Prove It Moves","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#h_bridge.half[0].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"70440a5a-dc95-4b9b-b581-4e3cb2844759\",\"type\":\"command\",\"x\":12,\"y\":14,\"w\":180,\"h\":40,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Off\",\"command\":\"hbridge\",\"arg0\":\"0\",\"arg1\":\"0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[0].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"5fdce12e-1366-4b7a-9eda-42ac862dc543\",\"type\":\"command\",\"x\":12,\"y\":66,\"w\":180,\"h\":40,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Drive forward 40%\",\"command\":\"hbridge\",\"arg0\":\"0\",\"arg1\":\"40\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[0].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"3822aacb-d5ad-4872-8668-a62eed72dd57\",\"type\":\"command\",\"x\":12,\"y\":118,\"w\":180,\"h\":40,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Drive reverse 40%\",\"command\":\"hbridge\",\"arg0\":\"0\",\"arg1\":\"-40\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[0].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":24,\"uid\":\"28ea2e1e-9dda-44c6-b5b7-5cbc0bdcfeb9\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":202,\"y\":14,\"w\":180,\"h\":188,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Drives the bridge directly, with no controller in the way: the plate should move one way, then the other. If it moves only one way, the DC map is wrong; if it moves the wrong way, invert the direction. Each press drives for four seconds and then releases on its own.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"c00c668c-f778-4599-bdcd-d707794fbe62\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":12,\"y\":176,\"w\":370,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Engine stopped only \\u2014 the ECU refuses to drive otherwise, and a start drops it mid-nudge. This bypasses the throttle controller entirely.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#ff8c28\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":26,"uid":"2b461be2-9d78-4052-a600-20e7f1817981","type":"panel","x":450,"y":326,"w":400,"h":200,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Right Now","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"6f08074c-b9df-4c40-bec9-2f1f35a3e19b\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":15,\"y\":14,\"w\":120,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_duty_1]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"329e1b85-990f-4dba-b7c2-af291ae9ceca\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":44,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Duty\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"c5902f14-8bab-4c19-bb26-5e91236693f7\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":145,\"y\":14,\"w\":120,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$etb_position_1]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":30,\"uid\":\"c4f785c9-575b-4d88-b542-9e0813c40a48\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":145,\"y\":44,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Position\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"c08b509c-ce66-4952-b088-99976f5f8286\",\"type\":\"indicator\",\"x\":275,\"y\":14,\"w\":105,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_en_1]\",\"onTitle\":\"DRIVING\",\"offTitle\":\"OFF\",\"onBg\":\"#30d158\",\"onFg\":\"#000000\",\"offBg\":\"#2a2a2e\",\"offFg\":\"#6e7178\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"89407620-87d0-4b57-a3b3-b91872f6d4b1\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":74,\"w\":370,\"h\":98,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Duty is what this bridge is driving and position is what came of it: duty at its limit with no movement is a mechanical or wiring fault, not a tuning one. DRIVING means these pins are live \\u2014 during a bench nudge it is lit while the throttle controller itself is standing down.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":33,"uid":"fdb1dae7-462d-4c3f-989e-952185c27967","type":"panel","x":870,"y":46,"w":400,"h":100,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Its Parts","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"90e6b49d-9779-4763-b12b-cbfc6e4871f6\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":10,\"w\":350,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":11,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Throttle Body A  (what it drives)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Functions/Electronic throttle/Throttle body A\"}},{\"id\":35,\"uid\":\"b0c6155f-6caf-44df-a360-a61696b23e20\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":38,\"w\":350,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":12,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Half Bridge B  (the other one)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Electrical/Half Bridges/Half Bridge B\"}}]"}}]},"Configuration/Electrical/Half Bridges/Half Bridge B":{"uid":"aa18b2dd-ae68-412c-8661-93ae920aef79","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":608,"minWidth":1280,"canvasStatic":3,"canvasAnchor":0,"guideW":0,"guideH":0,"title":"Half Bridge B","layout":0,"gridColumns":2,"focusIndex":0,"borderColor":"","borderWidth":0,"borderStyle":1,"borderRadius":4,"titleFont":"","titleColor":"","titlePadding":4,"titleStyle":1,"titlePlace":0,"titleEdge":0,"titleAlign":0,"widgets":[{"id":1,"uid":"4cbf884c-107f-40e1-aaab-cc9d06e3c943","type":"checkbox","x":10,"y":3,"w":22,"h":22,"groupId":2,"props":{"signalName":"h_bridge.half[1].enabled"}},{"id":2,"uid":"19efcdae-d407-4e65-85d8-00a1c8ee2d2b","type":"label","x":40,"y":5,"w":90,"h":20,"groupId":2,"props":{"labelText":"Enabled","align":"Left","fontName":"|16|0|0"}},{"id":3,"uid":"6dfe1352-a110-4d5d-91a8-a3169c4d6ac8","type":"label","x":136,"y":4,"w":864,"h":40,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"A bidirectional driver: it realises whichever bus signal it is pointed at. An electronic throttle servo, a PWM or BAC idle valve, a DC motor — or, with the other bridge, one coil of a bipolar stepper. There are two, and that is the whole supply.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":4,"uid":"73ef1fd1-bf99-45f6-b097-06d01e486656","type":"panel","x":10,"y":46,"w":420,"h":104,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Commanded By","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#h_bridge.half[1].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"494c5765-c299-48f5-9960-5650b4b33d37\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Demand Signal\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"e672f9b6-ec5b-4cf6-a26e-734b40a69610\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":156,\"y\":12,\"w\":200,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[1].demand_sig\"}},{\"id\":7,\"uid\":\"3aaaa234-720b-4467-9eac-38877d138e9e\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Enable Signal\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":8,\"uid\":\"abbc58f9-1443-43f2-b7aa-46c3c91699d7\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":156,\"y\":42,\"w\":200,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[1].enable_sig\"}}]"}},{"id":9,"uid":"5b040cb4-40bf-4481-9167-43a0c0fd0373","type":"label","x":10,"y":156,"w":410,"h":120,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Demand is the number the bridge drives to; Enable is the signal that permits it to drive at all — and a bridge drives only while it is actively enabled, which is what makes an unconfigured one safe. Whichever module owns the actuator publishes both: the throttle its etb_duty and etb_en, the stepper its coil demand and enable. A module with no bridge pointed at it moves nothing at all, however well it is tuned.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":10,"uid":"2d5ed573-2d95-426f-b028-44bea12eabf2","type":"panel","x":10,"y":278,"w":420,"h":194,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Drive","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#h_bridge.half[1].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":11,\"uid\":\"00c81dfb-1745-4de4-93c5-5edd548f6747\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"DC Map\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":12,\"uid\":\"e872318d-848b-4c30-bf44-62e5b695e6ab\",\"type\":\"combobox\",\"x\":156,\"y\":12,\"w\":200,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[1].dc_map\"}},{\"id\":13,\"uid\":\"c774a1ff-c065-4c20-8087-5ea20d952fbd\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Max Authority\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":14,\"uid\":\"012139b5-4119-4443-80e6-5202953890c1\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":156,\"y\":42,\"w\":108,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[1].dc_max_pct\"}},{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"f07d8c82-79fb-428c-a22f-7917f864d283\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":74,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.half[1].dir_invert\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"8133dd72-512e-4d22-b648-d09ddf23c58a\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":71,\"w\":220,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Direction Invert\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"5f98c498-b1a8-44cc-bf9e-3ab115b482b3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":116,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"PWM Frequency\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"8fc8e73c-d504-4609-a92a-d0d0e29de003\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":156,\"y\":112,\"w\":121,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"h_bridge.pwm_freq_hz\"}}]"}},{"id":19,"uid":"628df8d8-2d6e-418a-811f-139a76298a92","type":"label","x":10,"y":478,"w":410,"h":120,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"DC MAP follows the PRODUCER's sign convention, not the load: unipolar passes a signed demand straight through (-100..+100, which is what the throttle publishes), bipolar reads 0..100 with 50 as stop. Getting it backwards is quiet and nasty — a signed demand read as bipolar gives zero drive at +50 and full reverse at -50, so a calibration sweep measures no travel at all. The PWM frequency is shared by BOTH halves.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":20,"uid":"3c702901-9ec6-4ef1-9c0b-ddb49531a6ea","type":"panel","x":450,"y":46,"w":400,"h":270,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Prove It Moves","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#h_bridge.half[1].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"e1e18b48-b813-4b07-91fb-8af557b8ce07\",\"type\":\"command\",\"x\":12,\"y\":14,\"w\":180,\"h\":40,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Off\",\"command\":\"hbridge\",\"arg0\":\"1\",\"arg1\":\"0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[1].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"1dcfc686-094b-4d40-b68e-7f608669fe86\",\"type\":\"command\",\"x\":12,\"y\":66,\"w\":180,\"h\":40,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Drive forward 40%\",\"command\":\"hbridge\",\"arg0\":\"1\",\"arg1\":\"40\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[1].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"72716d1f-972f-4ff1-a8b6-f58dcfc414c0\",\"type\":\"command\",\"x\":12,\"y\":118,\"w\":180,\"h\":40,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Drive reverse 40%\",\"command\":\"hbridge\",\"arg0\":\"1\",\"arg1\":\"-40\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#h_bridge.half[1].enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":24,\"uid\":\"9bc94f0b-6501-4f11-89e8-a9d67d14df85\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":202,\"y\":14,\"w\":180,\"h\":188,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Drives the bridge directly, with no controller in the way: the plate should move one way, then the other. If it moves only one way, the DC map is wrong; if it moves the wrong way, invert the direction. Each press drives for four seconds and then releases on its own.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"e609428b-de15-4f05-9b9a-51b350449909\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":12,\"y\":176,\"w\":370,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Engine stopped only \\u2014 the ECU refuses to drive otherwise, and a start drops it mid-nudge. This bypasses the throttle controller entirely.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#ff8c28\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":26,"uid":"d2e4fd9d-97e7-4307-97f2-87b5437c49dc","type":"panel","x":450,"y":326,"w":400,"h":200,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Right Now","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"6da327f1-94f1-40c5-ba13-6cb05286f8d8\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":15,\"y\":14,\"w\":120,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_duty_2]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"804bfbce-e341-4654-8b10-16d6f689f1b4\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":44,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Duty\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"9f15152a-17a0-48fc-ba72-aae790052be4\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":145,\"y\":14,\"w\":120,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$etb_position_2]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":30,\"uid\":\"50883174-a50d-4ba1-9b60-d3b9aaebf0dd\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":145,\"y\":44,\"w\":120,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Position\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"6ef34684-a827-4801-bbec-52585e88009b\",\"type\":\"indicator\",\"x\":275,\"y\":14,\"w\":105,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$hbridge_en_2]\",\"onTitle\":\"DRIVING\",\"offTitle\":\"OFF\",\"onBg\":\"#30d158\",\"onFg\":\"#000000\",\"offBg\":\"#2a2a2e\",\"offFg\":\"#6e7178\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"24a1def8-b9d7-4e73-8cee-edf965e63854\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":15,\"y\":74,\"w\":370,\"h\":98,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Duty is what this bridge is driving and position is what came of it: duty at its limit with no movement is a mechanical or wiring fault, not a tuning one. DRIVING means these pins are live \\u2014 during a bench nudge it is lit while the throttle controller itself is standing down.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":33,"uid":"277ffc4e-1a75-4435-8f4e-cd3eb099a1dc","type":"panel","x":870,"y":46,"w":400,"h":100,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Its Parts","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"1c79bf61-449b-49e4-befa-68f8dc1902c3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":10,\"w\":350,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":11,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Throttle Body B  (what it drives)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Engine Functions/Electronic throttle/Throttle Body B\"}},{\"id\":35,\"uid\":\"2f237edc-223d-4b32-891e-155f087a69e7\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":38,\"w\":350,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":12,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Half Bridge A  (the other one)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"link\":\"Configuration/Electrical/Half Bridges/Half Bridge A\"}}]"}}]},"Configuration/Lua Scripting":{"uid":"e2d97beb-34f9-4384-ba96-b53932e6f998","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":700,"minWidth":1280,"canvasStatic":3,"canvasAnchor":0,"guideW":0,"guideH":0,"title":"Lua Scripting","layout":0,"gridColumns":2,"focusIndex":0,"borderColor":"","borderWidth":0,"borderStyle":1,"borderRadius":4,"titleFont":"","titleColor":"","titlePadding":4,"titleStyle":1,"titlePlace":0,"titleEdge":0,"titleAlign":0,"widgets":[{"id":1,"uid":"c6bb754e-7d72-4153-b48d-528d84baa152","type":"checkbox","x":10,"y":3,"w":22,"h":22,"groupId":2,"props":{"signalName":"lua.enabled"}},{"id":2,"uid":"5cbda999-f7b4-4f9f-b740-51077d87697d","type":"label","x":40,"y":5,"w":90,"h":20,"groupId":2,"props":{"labelText":"Enabled","align":"Left","fontName":"|16|0|0"}},{"id":3,"uid":"16eaf737-6cb0-425b-a5f6-cbcb553788c3","type":"label","x":136,"y":4,"w":864,"h":40,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"A script of your own, running on the ECU: it can read any channel, publish its own, send CAN frames and raise DTCs. What you type is held until you press Apply to ECU — a half-typed line never reaches a running engine — and Burn keeps it in the tune like any other setting.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":4,"uid":"96f361d3-9f5c-47f3-a8d2-b14d26af4d5f","type":"panel","x":10,"y":46,"w":400,"h":70,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Execution","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"2b1c29f9-fe7a-4c7b-b715-0338b7b0b917\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":241,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Script Watchdog\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#lua.enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"eb405012-3a12-45a4-b000-a40078358e61\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":257,\"y\":12,\"w\":119,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"lua.max_exec_us\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#lua.enabled] == 1\"}}]"}},{"id":7,"uid":"73b6a3f9-e11c-478c-9962-7a00f364d134","type":"panel","x":10,"y":128,"w":1260,"h":562,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Script","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#lua.enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":8,\"uid\":\"7c105431-077c-41bf-b7ef-8770b208c712\",\"type\":\"script\",\"x\":10,\"y\":12,\"w\":1240,\"h\":512,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{}}]"}}]},"Configuration/Electrical/Outputs/IGN1":{"uid":"04633c7c-d82f-48b3-8119-be55dc03bc5b","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":728,"minWidth":1280,"canvasStatic":3,"canvasAnchor":0,"guideW":0,"guideH":0,"title":"IGN1","layout":0,"gridColumns":2,"focusIndex":0,"borderColor":"","borderWidth":0,"borderStyle":1,"borderRadius":4,"titleFont":"","titleColor":"","titlePadding":4,"titleStyle":1,"titlePlace":0,"titleEdge":0,"titleAlign":0,"widgets":[{"id":1,"uid":"d7482e66-21cc-4e45-880a-ac053f34606c","type":"label","x":10,"y":4,"w":846,"h":24,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"What this pin does: a coil, an injector, or a generic output. A generic output's conditions, value and shaping are the rest of the page.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":2,"uid":"1a701c78-d47a-4403-b4ed-e1ad9e50526a","type":"panel","x":10,"y":30,"w":400,"h":166,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"This Pin","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":3,\"uid\":\"d32e7a9e-a357-4c9b-9a9d-38462126da90\",\"type\":\"pinwire\",\"x\":10,\"y\":12,\"w\":380,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"resource\":\"IGN1\"}},{\"id\":4,\"uid\":\"7d9256f8-b989-4b83-8ac8-e9698a84f695\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":34,\"w\":170,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":2,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Function\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"29e1d790-4dac-4c82-b400-60edb97171c1\",\"type\":\"combobox\",\"x\":186,\"y\":30,\"w\":190,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":2,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"outputs.output[*].function\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"45e1442e-6315-4afb-af49-127b43f24b86\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":64,