a63-e783-4d9f-9954-4cd9b4f31950","type":"label","x":136,"y":4,"w":864,"h":40,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"While the throttle is MOVING, take manifold pressure from the predicted table instead of the sensor, and model the fuel film explicitly. Together these replace transient throttle — use one approach or the other, not both.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":4,"uid":"55c4f383-415a-44a9-88f0-cb6f1a05b00e","type":"panel","x":10,"y":46,"w":420,"h":104,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Prediction","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"8d72e025-1e20-4aa2-a527-abad7ebb7708\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":170,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Predicted MAP Time\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.map_predict_enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"53a00034-e501-4959-843d-3c542ed032df\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":186,\"y\":12,\"w\":115,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"fuel_calculator.map_predict_hold_ms\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.map_predict_enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":7,\"uid\":\"05fd264e-6841-4bc5-8024-29c88d2c6943\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":46,\"w\":170,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Throttle Source\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.map_predict_enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":8,\"uid\":\"5fd4e421-ca22-495c-b999-4497810af700\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":186,\"y\":42,\"w\":200,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"fuel_calculator.tps_src\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.map_predict_enabled] == 1\"}}]"}},{"id":9,"uid":"bb50d130-8cd9-4f8e-a870-4195f28add5c","type":"label","x":10,"y":156,"w":410,"h":72,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"The hold is how long prediction lasts after the movement that triggered it. Too short and it lets go before the sensor has caught up, which is the lean hole it exists to fill; a long or shared MAP hose wants more. Around 200 ms suits a typical install.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":10,"uid":"ac4797ec-4902-4bee-9aae-eac09f50c78d","type":"panel","x":10,"y":256,"w":420,"h":140,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Fuel Film","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":11,\"uid\":\"3fb17c65-0b57-4c29-9504-3cb38c00308f\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":16,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"fuel_calculator.wallfilm_enabled\"}},{\"id\":12,\"uid\":\"710eaa08-b452-4fe9-a436-7308ba0efc8d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":13,\"w\":220,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Wall-film model enabled\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":13,\"uid\":\"c4c704ac-4c95-4d8c-9aa2-8e1eb89cb6a0\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":60,\"w\":170,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Film Pooling\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.wallfilm_enabled] == 1 and [#fuel_calculator.wallfilm_tau_ms] > 0\"}},{\"id\":14,\"uid\":\"c04542bc-cfe9-421c-82a6-bcb2c481c548\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":186,\"y\":56,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"fuel_calculator.wallfilm_x_pct\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.wallfilm_enabled] == 1 and [#fuel_calculator.wallfilm_tau_ms] > 0\"}},{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"26555d6f-81af-4f87-a332-8f66f99cdc17\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":90,\"w\":170,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Evaporation Time\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.wallfilm_enabled] == 1\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"434a9160-d54b-4b6c-806e-b8adfe42f13d\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":186,\"y\":86,\"w\":115,\"h\":28,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"fuel_calculator.wallfilm_tau_ms\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#fuel_calculator.wallfilm_enabled] == 1\"}}]"}},{"id":17,"uid":"88f62dfb-c15e-4ae6-8825-9cf78b7dba62","type":"label","x":10,"y":402,"w":410,"h":136,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Pooling is how much of each injection lands on the port wall: 5-10% for a well matched port and injector on a warm engine, 25-30% where the inlet turns sharply or the spray misses the valve, around 50% cold. Evaporation is how long the film takes to give it back — about 200 ms warm, up to 400 ms cold. Optimise injection TIMING first: a lean spike caused by closed-valve injection is not a pooling problem, and pooling used to hide it just makes the engine rich everywhere else.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":18,"uid":"bf7492ee-b261-4e5c-b77e-dcd7d45fcbcc","type":"panel","x":450,"y":46,"w":400,"h":260,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"Right Now","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","children":"[{\"id\":19,\"uid\":\"789b25ab-364a-4ede-8cf9-266b8af7142f\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":16,\"y\":14,\"w\":180,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$map_est]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":20,\"uid\":\"e2866f74-df21-47c3-bf5a-5af50a074529\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":16,\"y\":44,\"w\":180,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":8,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Manifold Pressure\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"0f9b8734-31ac-4f82-95aa-1c17cc74f4cc\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":211,\"y\":14,\"w\":180,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$map]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontName\":\"|20|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"09fc90b5-564e-4f6a-bc9c-508e5ec77825\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":211,\"y\":44,\"w\":180,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":9,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Measured\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"65b378a2-c710-4de6-a05f-be4a60e6a256\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":16,\"y\":84,\"w\":180,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":10,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$map_predicted]\",\"format\":\"%.1f\",\"fontN