w_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"1d1f47e2-9460-4c7e-8013-0322f392e9da\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":81,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The pin reads below this \\u2014 an open circuit, or a short to ground.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"54b28a31-7dc2-4714-affb-d49636f27f9b\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":104,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"89b16666-77c8-49cf-ba0b-13788056c696\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":102,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Raw High\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":19,\"uid\":\"01c5fb8c-8550-4609-b99b-96d5f9a6c32f\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":102,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_raw_max\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":20,\"uid\":\"9fd11c10-de38-4277-9065-4390592f7717\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":102,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.raw_max\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"5d5bd649-0032-42aa-a5f5-d3f6af994398\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":106,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P1129\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"a6e36948-6c58-4d9e-9cb2-157dfe08d56e\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":127,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The pin reads above this \\u2014 a short to power, or a missing pull-down.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"85f032d3-4701-471a-a777-7cab03a2e767\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":148,\"w\":500,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Plausibility  (calibrated reading)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":24,\"uid\":\"10c378dc-2e62-457e-bfd8-1f41abcef49b\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":172,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min\"}},{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"27c3314f-3479-4955-a337-1204eb364611\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":170,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading Low\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":26,\"uid\":\"3ab60d0d-0102-4a08-ad6c-ebf8ad746f2b\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":170,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_min\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"fdb95d0f-c338-49b9-a778-189be0d8cb97\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":170,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_min\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"5dfd1445-b5ef-4065-b7b5-45f99fa014b6\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":174,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P112A\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"9eee2338-6405-4474-9275-8a3b2a1d9024\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":195,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is below what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":30,\"uid\":\"50808764-447b-43ad-8423-5f0bfc137a6d\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":218,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max\"}},{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"3fb1ae2d-97ba-4d1c-bee3-2adc40c6ff91\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":216,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading High\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"b775b9fe-84a8-4e6b-860f-54a734afc7cd\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":216,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_max\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":33,\"uid\":\"b834dba4-1efc-459e-8f3d-db915e4a614e\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":216,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_max\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"4525ae05-dad6-459a-85a8-9536793423b8\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":220,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P112B\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":35,\"uid\":\"66ecbbad-5569-41cf-a035-47583071d68a\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":241,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is above what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":36,\"uid\":\"ee328410-6175-4eb8-9d49-03688fecf664\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":38,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"DTC Delay\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":37,\"uid\":\"acb70bbb-8af3-425e-9ec6-805afece7cc4\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":706,\"y\":34,\"w\":123,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_delay_ms\"}},{\"id\":38,\"uid\":\"b5f54e8d-9c04-4c61-9ff7-36a52f32f28d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":68,\"w\":400,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"How long a check has to keep failing before it becomes a fault. A sensor that blips once on a starter crank is not a broken sensor.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":39,\"uid\":\"3dcc9841-ffae-4b53-bce0-fb090b653de2\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":110,\"w\":400,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Precondition\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":40,\"uid\":\"0ba1fcf3-900d-4c8c-a535-3d1a1ea86eef\",\"type\":\"expression\",\"x\":560,\"y\":132,\"w\":400,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].precond_expr\"}},{\"id\":41,\"uid\":\"3313a20f-2fff-443f-9613-674056b12711\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":164,\"w\":400,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The plausibility checks only run while this holds \\u2014 an oil pressure of zero is a fault at 3000 rpm and the truth with the engine stopped.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":42,\"uid\":\"857a4e25-8214-4642-a017-034f8e8735ae\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":990,\"y\":34,\"w\":250,\"h\":170,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The electrical pair tests the RAW input in the input's own units, before calibration; the plausibility pair tests the calibrated reading. Severity is what the DTC records and what the protection levels read. A check with no code is one this sensor cannot report, and is not offered \\u2014 which is why two sensors show different rows here.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}}],"elementScope":"sensors.sensor[egt_11]"},"Configuration/Sensors/Engine/Exhaust Gas Temperature 12":{"uid":"67b2bdf3-0670-435c-ad6e-e21cfae558d9","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":700,"minWidth":1280,"canvasStatic":3,"canvasAnchor":0,"guideW":0,"guideH":0,"title":"Exhaust Gas Temperature 12","layout":0,"gridColumns":2,"focusIndex":0,"borderColor":"","borderWidth":0,"borderStyle":1,"borderRadius"