ads above this \\u2014 a short to power, or a missing pull-down.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"b248eea3-b9b5-48f7-bd2f-d1f2929a2d2a\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":148,\"w\":500,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Plausibility  (calibrated reading)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":24,\"uid\":\"e3e6e317-53c4-4ecb-8f3e-98d3a682007b\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":172,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min\"}},{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"20c0162b-8687-46b0-b302-7f3f013e83d3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":170,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading Low\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":26,\"uid\":\"dfd4302e-6bc2-41d0-8abe-cb0a5095f907\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":170,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_min\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"c767feb2-7cbd-4686-8f3a-0f4a7a143ed9\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":170,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_min\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"81bf19a6-86cc-4314-bf60-144dbb0ba2a0\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":174,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P1062\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"6e421474-243e-4bc6-adfe-6fff09ab16cc\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":195,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is below what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":30,\"uid\":\"adb28a73-2c06-4f3e-83cc-5af94d08a1d1\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":218,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max\"}},{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"fbecce9b-b74a-40ea-8d1e-2c8902aa2d32\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":216,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading High\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"9604859f-8b51-4b44-ad54-81f39b6c5c88\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":216,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_max\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":33,\"uid\":\"295f25ba-42df-496c-9296-0d2e0b87de92\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":216,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_max\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"5a374df9-0017-4d56-9b7f-eac75fd66ed6\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":220,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P1063\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":35,\"uid\":\"e1c2b9e1-ddb6-459e-bb1d-cb5579ce9bc6\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":241,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is above what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":36,\"uid\":\"5105d8ac-deef-44a6-8172-b25d047f7c63\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":38,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"DTC Delay\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":37,\"uid\":\"9afbecc3-c555-4d30-85bb-457a785f2dbe\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":706,\"y\":34,\"w\":123,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_delay_ms\"}},{\"id\":38,\"uid\":\"571ba9b0-a0c3-4a1b-a5f5-263e9d184e44\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":68,\"w\":400,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"How long a check has to keep failing before it becomes a fault. A sensor that blips once on a starter crank is not a broken sensor.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":39,\"uid\":\"89b047ad-1106-4a92-992d-ca304b0f2ec2\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":110,\"w\":400,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Precondition\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":40,\"uid\":\"129c9d77-cf16-460d-98ff-4639ff4bbe1d\",\"type\":\"expression\",\"x\":560,\"y\":132,\"w\":400,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].precond_expr\"}},{\"id\":41,\"uid\":\"99e1b469-c152-4b7a-a43b-d4634698ddd5\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":164,\"w\":400,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The plausibility checks only run while this holds \\u2014 an oil pressure of zero is a fault at 3000 rpm and the truth with the engine stopped.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":42,\"uid\":\"c665ebe7-6423-4cef-9cb4-535dc7e5bc3d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":990,\"y\":34,\"w\":250,\"h\":170,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The electrical pair tests the RAW input in the input's own units, before calibration; the plausibility pair tests the calibrated reading. Severity is what the DTC records and what the protection levels read. A check with no code is one this sensor cannot report, and is not offered \\u2014 which is why two sensors show different rows here.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}}],"elementScope":"sensors.sensor[lambda_12]"},"Configuration/Sensors/O2 & Lambda/Wideband O2 13":{"uid":"e2132833-d185-4116-863a-5cb01d6ec96d","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":700,"