above what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":36,\"uid\":\"eaca6458-f81a-4d7b-9be4-9334166e83c2\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":38,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"DTC Delay\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":37,\"uid\":\"00d1568e-8c2c-4177-8787-001503af2259\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":706,\"y\":34,\"w\":123,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_delay_ms\"}},{\"id\":38,\"uid\":\"769130d1-8309-4125-b1d8-fb5a445723c1\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":68,\"w\":400,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"How long a check has to keep failing before it becomes a fault. A sensor that blips once on a starter crank is not a broken sensor.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":39,\"uid\":\"56aaf374-1395-4f11-a0e6-b22b78017445\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":110,\"w\":400,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Precondition\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":40,\"uid\":\"5cdaa234-8bf5-40b0-9974-9e26106ccc8d\",\"type\":\"expression\",\"x\":560,\"y\":132,\"w\":400,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].precond_expr\"}},{\"id\":41,\"uid\":\"28bd75ae-7668-472c-b90b-2f6c0321644b\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":164,\"w\":400,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The plausibility checks only run while this holds \\u2014 an oil pressure of zero is a fault at 3000 rpm and the truth with the engine stopped.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":42,\"uid\":\"b25106e1-094e-4062-9f26-14792c914899\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":990,\"y\":34,\"w\":250,\"h\":170,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The electrical pair tests the RAW input in the input's own units, before calibration; the plausibility pair tests the calibrated reading. Severity is what the DTC records and what the protection levels read. A check with no code is one this sensor cannot report, and is not offered \\u2014 which is why two sensors show different rows here.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}}],"elementScope":"sensors.sensor[lambda_13]"},"Configuration/Sensors/O2 & Lambda/Wideband O2 14":{"uid":"b06d141f-592b-4f21-a836-2f1a8c6d46dc","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":700,"minWidth":1280,"canvasStatic":3,"canvasAnchor":0,"guideW":0,"guideH":0,"title":"Wideband O2 14","layout":0,"gridColumns":2,"focusIndex":0,"borderColor":"","borderWidth":0,"borderStyle":1,"borderRadius":4,"titleFont":"","titleColor":"","titlePadding":4,"titleStyle":1,"titlePlace":0,"titleEdge":0,"titleAlign":0,"widgets":[{"id":1,"uid":"f71b273b-17bd-4fb1-aac1-f283a1b688b2","type":"checkbox","x":10,"y":3,"w":22,"h":22,"groupId":2,"props":{"signalName":"sensors.sensor[*].enabled"}},{"id":2,"uid":"6bfe4942-7205-4678-bbe6-10a3abc7a80d","type":"label","x":40,"y":5,"w":90,"h":20,"groupId":2,"props":{"labelText":"Enabled","align":"Left","fontName":"|16|0|0"}},{"id":3,"uid":"9e803379-65ff-4999-bc3f-6ecf16807b2c","type":"label","x":136,"y":4,"w":379,"h":24,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"What this input is wired to, and what its curve makes of it.","align":"Left","fontName":"|15|0|0","fgColor":"#8a8f98","wrap":"1"}},{"id":4,"uid":"175ac969-b713-46e6-8c57-f962affd3e6e","type":"panel","x":10,"y":30,"w":300,"h":662,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"1 · Input","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#sensors.sensor[*].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":5,\"uid\":\"81f15dbe-8985-4ea5-bc15-0942c9ca7fcf\",\"type\":\"value\",\"x\":12,\"y\":10,\"w\":274,\"h\":54,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"[$~]\",\"fontName\":\"|26|0|0\",\"align\":\"Center\",\"borderWidth\":\"1\",\"borderRadius\":\"4\"}},{\"id\":6,\"uid\":\"81597061-bd60-4a02-96a5-31a1632aca92\",\"