d here by that frame and the field's start bit. A field whose own Signal is set is greyed in the list \\u2014 the frame writes that channel itself, and the sensor publishing it too would put two producers on one channel.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}},{"id":15,"uid":"99659ad7-de07-48e4-814a-d5d62c6c8ad5","type":"panel","x":320,"y":30,"w":630,"h":662,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"2 · Calibration","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#sensors.sensor[*].enabled] == 1","children":"[{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"5aa6a994-bdfc-471d-a63e-d5e4f8953a9e\",\"type\":\"table\",\"x\":10,\"y\":10,\"w\":600,\"h\":96,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].cal\",\"axisMode\":\"1\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"displayUnitX\":\"Auto\",\"displayUnitY\":\"Auto\",\"cellTrace\":\"2\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"b64ca015-52ba-4d12-865d-4721c9e81830\",\"type\":\"curve\",\"x\":10,\"y\":114,\"w\":600,\"h\":450,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].cal\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"axisUnit\":\"Auto\",\"valueUnit\":\"Auto\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"0acd6187-055b-47bf-a649-fa630b0a0fde\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":568,\"w\":600,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Raw in along the top, reading out underneath. Right-click either for insert, delete, linearise \\u2014 or to save this curve to a file and load it into the next car with the same sensor.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\",\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].cal\"}},{\"id\":19,\"uid\":\"452f4913-8167-4fac-add3-f0342d8ad77c\",\"type\":\"bands\",\"x\":10,\"y\":10,\"w\":600,\"h\":616,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].cal\"}}]"}},{"id":20,"uid":"e708e63b-bbf0-4e57-b1cc-dc9348b00083","type":"panel","x":960,"y":30,"w":310,"h":662,"groupId":0,"props":{"labelText":"3 · Output","layoutMode":"0","padding":"0","enableCondition":"[#sensors.sensor[*].enabl