his \\u2014 a short to power, or a missing pull-down.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"cec42bdd-76ee-487d-a557-40692f3df3e5\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":148,\"w\":500,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Plausibility  (calibrated reading)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":24,\"uid\":\"1308c790-2df5-4072-9e7f-46b6eb9c65bc\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":172,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min\"}},{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"24bb501b-648a-4f8f-a1ce-51a1b7aa4f52\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":170,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading Low\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":26,\"uid\":\"6a8e0c5a-9aae-431c-83e4-526fea8543e3\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":170,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_min\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"65519a14-52fc-42a3-a154-7ebb72429073\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":170,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_min\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"588b1e9b-a701-4d9c-b455-1bfec37582eb\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":174,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P131A\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"379a4eae-f1b9-4d20-aaba-ad35f1fd84f6\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":195,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is below what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":30,\"uid\":\"222beeea-1a46-4a76-991a-c4eef3f67f75\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":218,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max\"}},{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"114e1b8b-527f-49e3-9421-792ca79af1a4\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":216,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading High\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"b28c2961-5ca1-4cb9-8812-bc45be02209a\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":216,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_max\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":33,\"uid\":\"fe194332-0800-4a22-94fa-db394277404d\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":216,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_max\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"61bd61cf-101b-466d-800c-4cf1168923ef\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":220,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P131B\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":35,\"uid\":\"e641f2e5-7d50-4251-b015-8abcb679205d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":241,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is above what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":36,\"uid\":\"f2cf8216-6b07-4010-b7b3-83802ef8433e\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":38,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"DTC Delay\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":37,\"uid\":\"c44840bd-a57d-4d0e-9b9c-ab655fd3bd47\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":706,\"y\":34,\"w\":123,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_delay_ms\"}},{\"id\":38,\"uid\":\"27f63c42-ce1a-4c1f-8c1e-009338546472\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":68,\"w\":400,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"How long a check has to keep failing before it becomes a fault. A sensor that blips once on a starter crank is not a broken sensor.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":39,\"uid\":\"0270c385-5f38-4849-b123-6672cf03604d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":110,\"w\":400,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Precondition\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":40,\"uid\":\"910cc53f-d8ca-49f7-952a-38c6dc2616f1\",\"type\":\"expression\",\"x\":560,\"y\":132,\"w\":400,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].precond_expr\"}},{\"id\":41,\"uid\":\"3ea561ef-cdae-4e57-910b-c905755347be\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":164,\"w\":400,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The plausibility checks only run while this holds \\u2014 an oil pressure of zero is a fault at 3000 rpm and the truth with the engine stopped.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":42,\"uid\":\"22b7fb4f-be2a-4de6-8ad0-a8096da0193b\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":990,\"y\":34,\"w\":250,\"h\":170,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The electrical pair tests the RAW input in the input's own units, before calibration; the plausibility pair tests the calibrated reading. Severity is what the DTC records and what the protection levels read. A check with no code is one this sensor cannot report, and is not offered \\u2014 which is why two sensors show different rows here.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}}],"elementScope":"sensors.sensor[nitrous_pressure_3]"},"Configuration/Sensors/Nitrous/Nitrous Pressure 4":{"uid":"2c522879-01ee-461e-810c-e1af258f6d28","canvasWidth":1280,"canvasHeight":700,"mi