nable.raw_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":15,\"uid\":\"1d6e8465-8b6a-425e-b3bb-448ab2bafb7d\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":60,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P13E8\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":16,\"uid\":\"3d766383-4092-4410-b315-dc92310d046a\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":81,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":3,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The pin reads below this \\u2014 an open circuit, or a short to ground.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":17,\"uid\":\"87d8f08f-5207-4bae-b9d8-c192020b82e5\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":104,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max\"}},{\"id\":18,\"uid\":\"46c10ba0-6163-4a8b-8a9e-d0baa51be164\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":102,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Raw High\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":19,\"uid\":\"cec797d0-763b-4bcb-ba9f-52fa07b025f6\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":102,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_raw_max\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":20,\"uid\":\"4037da26-471a-4f0e-8557-c756caad1809\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":102,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.raw_max\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":21,\"uid\":\"e1761bbb-5b3d-4556-832e-2249cebcd593\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":106,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P13E9\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.raw_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":22,\"uid\":\"61616409-987f-49e6-809c-533398b188c7\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":127,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":4,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The pin reads above this \\u2014 a short to power, or a missing pull-down.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":23,\"uid\":\"316635af-1d09-4efb-9d0c-96fbd8516b49\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":10,\"y\":148,\"w\":500,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Plausibility  (calibrated reading)\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":24,\"uid\":\"64d4ac7b-27c7-423a-ba3b-02ce6e52f230\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":172,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min\"}},{\"id\":25,\"uid\":\"8d55f991-e202-4483-b95f-c90456e49d50\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":170,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading Low\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":26,\"uid\":\"bcb881da-17cc-47ed-989a-25fdd40c8d0b\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":170,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_min\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":27,\"uid\":\"243630a8-784e-4afa-8230-f2a32e643465\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":170,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_min\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":28,\"uid\":\"516a407b-8018-489a-9e5f-3f3b907936ee\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":174,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P13EA\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_min] == 1\"}},{\"id\":29,\"uid\":\"b2305654-87f6-4ada-91b9-a5f8f584abea\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":195,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":5,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is below what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":30,\"uid\":\"8d94ee08-ff5f-47e0-be75-df44cba74419\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"x\":10,\"y\":218,\"w\":22,\"h\":22,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max\"}},{\"id\":31,\"uid\":\"ab370124-bbad-40d4-993f-b164530348d8\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":40,\"y\":216,\"w\":194,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Detect Reading High\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":32,\"uid\":\"fa1f3034-58d0-481a-8136-0c1b998a7f76\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":240,\"y\":216,\"w\":96,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_op_max\",\"displayUnit\":\"Auto\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":33,\"uid\":\"48324095-f33c-4e93-a8e3-e228059bb988\",\"type\":\"enum\",\"x\":346,\"y\":216,\"w\":110,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_severity.op_max\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":34,\"uid\":\"b0bf2f25-8553-4f5a-b033-81cdea029edb\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":462,\"y\":220,\"w\":60,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"P13EB\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"enableCondition\":\"[#sensors.sensor[*].diag_enable.op_max] == 1\"}},{\"id\":35,\"uid\":\"bf0b4245-f077-47bb-9b3e-fa4636eee3f5\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":34,\"y\":241,\"w\":515,\"h\":16,\"groupId\":6,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The calibrated reading is above what this engine could plausibly produce.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":36,\"uid\":\"c0e985cd-b360-468b-85f8-9d47c9e05e60\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":38,\"w\":140,\"h\":20,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"DTC Delay\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|16|0|0\"}},{\"id\":37,\"uid\":\"0bd2e16a-51d7-443c-acb2-0f5a612410f7\",\"type\":\"configedit\",\"x\":706,\"y\":34,\"w\":123,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":7,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].diag_delay_ms\"}},{\"id\":38,\"uid\":\"f5526a65-37bc-4821-9a3e-eb2ba1220dd3\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":68,\"w\":400,\"h\":44,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"How long a check has to keep failing before it becomes a fault. A sensor that blips once on a starter crank is not a broken sensor.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":39,\"uid\":\"41c4f6bb-6719-4015-b4b0-30f3ad816fcd\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":110,\"w\":400,\"h\":18,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"Precondition\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|1|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\"}},{\"id\":40,\"uid\":\"bbc565c7-c197-412d-a4f2-05c61b741374\",\"type\":\"expression\",\"x\":560,\"y\":132,\"w\":400,\"h\":30,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"signalName\":\"sensors.sensor[*].precond_expr\"}},{\"id\":41,\"uid\":\"0e616af1-1586-4e4f-a2f8-449191daf5e5\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":560,\"y\":164,\"w\":400,\"h\":62,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The plausibility checks only run while this holds \\u2014 an oil pressure of zero is a fault at 3000 rpm and the truth with the engine stopped.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}},{\"id\":42,\"uid\":\"a907510f-1ffa-4d67-878d-331dbf6b547a\",\"type\":\"label\",\"x\":990,\"y\":34,\"w\":250,\"h\":170,\"groupId\":0,\"props\":{\"labelText\":\"The electrical pair tests the RAW input in the input's own units, before calibration; the plausibility pair tests the calibrated reading. Severity is what the DTC records and what the protection levels read. A check with no code is one this sensor cannot report, and is not offered \\u2014 which is why two sensors show different rows here.\",\"align\":\"Left\",\"fontName\":\"|15|0|0\",\"fgColor\":\"#8a8f98\",\"wrap\":\"1\"}}]"}}],"elementScope":"sensors.sensor[tumble_valve_2]"},"Configuration/Sensors/Engine":{"ui